# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) to un-skip `test/live.test.ts`.
#
# The canonical home for this is the shared `secrets/connectors.env` at the repo root —
# one file for every connector, `<PROVIDER>_`-prefixed so two providers' secrets cannot
# collide. This per-package file works as a fallback, and `PLANIMA_TOKEN` in the
# environment wins over both, so a CI job holding the token in its secret store needs no
# file at all.
#
# Mint the token in Planima under `account settings → API`. Mint it as a READ-ONLY user:
# a Planima token carries the full access of whoever created it, and this connector only
# ever reads. An admin's token would work identically and cost far more if it leaked.
PLANIMA_TOKEN=
